# One extra page for the worker. Copy to worker/pages/<id>.env (git-ignored; e.g. name-nest.env).
# The service-role key never leaves this PC. Restart the worker after adding or changing a page.
# Lower-case letters, digits and hyphens. Also the ComfyUI name for this page's files (<id>/raw..., client <id>-worker).
PAGE_ID=name-nest
# The page's name in the log and the default PC folder name.
PAGE_LABEL=Name Nest
SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-OTHER-PROJECT.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=paste-the-service-role-or-secret-key
# PC backup folder for this page's cards. Empty = <OneDrive>\Pictures\<PAGE_LABEL>
OUTPUT_ROOT=
# Full reel videos. Empty = <OUTPUT_ROOT>\Reels
REELS_OUTPUT=
# Optional: the theme-preview picture's moment and cast (empty = the Unique Names mom-and-baby moment).
# PREVIEW_MOMENT=a father reading a picture book to his toddler by the window
# PREVIEW_CAST=the father: ...; the toddler: ...
# PREVIEW_DOLL_CAST=the dad doll: ...; the toddler doll: ...
# Name Nest (US page): an American family for the theme previews. Uncomment these three lines in name-nest.env.
# PREVIEW_MOMENT=a mother cuddling her baby on a cozy living-room couch by the window
# PREVIEW_CAST=the mother: a young Black American mother in her early thirties with deep brown skin and natural curls in a high puff, wearing a mustard-yellow cardigan over a cream T-shirt; the baby: a chubby six-month-old baby with deep brown skin and soft dark curls, wearing a rust romper
# PREVIEW_DOLL_CAST=the mom doll: a crocheted mother doll with dark-brown wool skin and chunky black yarn curls in a puff, a mustard knitted cardigan; the baby doll: a crocheted baby doll with dark-brown wool skin in a rust knitted romper
# Card photo look (2.7.2): this page's own vibrance / texture (0-100, 0 = off); unset = worker.env's (default 20 / 15)
# PHOTO_VIBRANCE=20
# PHOTO_TEXTURE=15
